# V374.6 keeps the verified V374.5 exchange-minimum and execution core unchanged.
# The actual minimum is minimum shares multiplied by
# final executable weighted price. Do not add a fixed MIN_EXECUTABLE_STAKE_USD.
# Never copy prior runtime state into either V374.6 data directory.
# Never store private keys, API secrets, wallet seeds, or VPS passwords here.
